  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Disculpa, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. ¿Tienes un momento?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069007300630075006C00700061002C0020006D00750063006800610063006800100003110000FF0101006F0061002E002000BF005400690065006E0065007300200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tuve una idea buenísima para ofrecer cierto\nservicio, pero me surgió un contratiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero ayudar a quienes tienen problemas para\nconciliar el sueño a causa de las pesadillas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Y sabes qué se me ocurrió? ¡Usar Hipnosis\npara que duerman como un bebé!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es que últimamente hay tanta gente que sufre\npesadillas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730020007100750065002000FA006C00740069006D0061006D0065006E007400650020006800610079002000740061006E00740061002000670065006E007400650020007100750065002000730075006600720065000A007000650073006100640069006C006C00610073002E002E002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cuestión es que ya me surgió el primer\nobstáculo con mi negocio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000630075006500730074006900F3006E00200065007300200071007500650020007900610020006D006500200073007500720067006900F300200065006C0020007000720069006D00650072000A006F00620073007400E100630075006C006F00200063006F006E0020006D00690020006E00650067006F00630069006F002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El Flamigo que trajo mi primera clienta no se\nqueda dormido por nada del mundo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Migo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00690067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Será que tiene mucha energía almacenada en\nel estómago y eso le impide dormirse?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mu, muuusha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075002C0020006D007500750075007300680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es nuestro primer encargo, así que Musharna\ntambién tiene los nervios de punta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso me gustaría pedirte a ti y a tus Pokémon\nque le muestren cómo se hace.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero que usen <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sobre el Flamigo y,\nluego, <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, usen <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> y <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sobre\neste Flamigo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Musha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075007300680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver si logran que mi Flamigo pueda dormir.\nLleva ya tres días sin pegar un ojo...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Migo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00690067006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo primero que hay que hacer es usar <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006F0020007000720069006D00650072006F00200071007500650020006800610079002000710075006500200068006100630065007200200065007300200075007300610072002000100002FF000006004800690070006E006F00730069007300100002FF000000002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Miren, ¡el Flamigo se quedó dormido!\nAhora aprovechen para usar <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El movimiento que hay que usar ahora\nes <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F00200071007500650020006800610079002000710075006500200075007300610072002000610068006F00720061000A00650073002000100002FF0000060043006F006D006500730075006500F1006F007300100002FF000000002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bien hecho!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004200690065006E00200068006500630068006F002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Flamigo está durmiendo como un bebé.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200046006C0061006D00690067006F002000650073007400E10020006400750072006D00690065006E0064006F00200063006F006D006F00200075006E002000620065006200E9002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchísimas gracias por hacer que mi Flamigo\nconciliara el sueño.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00750063006800ED00730069006D006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200068006100630065007200200071007500650020006D006900200046006C0061006D00690067006F000A0063006F006E00630069006C006900610072006100200065006C002000730075006500F1006F002E00100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Migooo!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A1004D00690067006F006F006F0021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Después de echarse una siestita, parece que\nmi Flamigo se siente mucho mejor.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Volveremos a usar su servicio!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo hicieron de maravilla! Teniéndolos como\nejemplo, seguro que Musharna lo hará sin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nproblemas a partir de ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
